SEC Financial Excel / sec-data audit fork

This repository is a modified fork of:
https://github.com/baimmm6767/sec-data

The original project and this modified distribution are provided under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The modifications add evidence-gated Excel output,
source and lineage sheets, semantic review queues, workbook verification,
fault-injection tests, and a smaller command-line boundary.

SEC EDGAR filings and extracted XBRL data are public source material. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the U.S. Securities and Exchange
Commission or by any filing company.
